%%{init: {"theme": "neutral"}}%%
%% Full per-signal detail (capture mechanism, which detector consumes it, exact thresholds):
%% see ../docs/measurement-semantics.md
flowchart TD
    RemoteInput["Remote input<br/>via TVEventHandler"] --> Timeline["Synchronized timeline"]
    Focus["Focus changes<br/>zero-footprint: native global focus<br/>listener + nativeID, no wrapper needed"] --> Timeline
    VisibleUpdate["Visible-update marker<br/>same native listener, posted after<br/>focus (best-effort, not frame-accurate)"] --> Timeline
    InteractionMarker["Interaction markers<br/>via mark() (explicit app call)"] --> Timeline
    Redux["Redux dispatches<br/>via createTelemetryMiddleware"] --> Timeline
    Selector["Redux selector invocations<br/>via telemetrySelector() wrapper<br/>(transparent passthrough)"] --> Timeline
    Network["Network requests<br/>automatic at install(): RN fetch + XHR clients<br/>shared XHR boundary, metadata only"] --> Timeline
    JSStall["JS stalls<br/>automatic at install(): one bounded timer<br/>monotonic overshoot heuristic<br/>50ms interval / threshold by default"] --> Timeline
    ReactCommit["React commits<br/>withTelemetryRoot at root registration<br/>profiling Fabric renderer<br/>render work + renderStartMs / commitTimeMs<br/>elapsed interval may include pauses"] --> Timeline
    FrameTiming["Android frame timing<br/>via native FrameMetrics listener"] --> Timeline
    ResourceSampling["Resource samples (CPU/memory)<br/>explicit startResourceSampling()/stopResourceSampling(),<br/>off by default, native HandlerThread sampler"] --> Timeline
    Lifecycle["Foreground/background transitions<br/>automatic at install(), ActivityLifecycleCallbacks<br/>(evidence only, no dedicated detector)"] --> Timeline

    ClockSync["Clock-sync samples<br/>periodic, piggybacked on other<br/>event pushes (~30s) + once at install()"] --> ClockMapping["Clock mapping (ClockMap)<br/>fits offset + scale from samples"]
    ClockMapping --> ReportOut
    Bookmarks["QA bookmarks<br/>workstation-side session-telemetry mark,<br/>mapped onto the session timeline<br/>via clock mapping"] --> ReportOut
    SessionMeta["Session metadata<br/>device info, once at install()"] --> ReportOut
    LossCount["Loss counter<br/>(real, always 0 — no detection wired up yet)"] --> Summary

    Timeline --> Windows["Interaction windows"]
    Timeline --> Summary["Session summary"]
    Windows --> ReactSummary["React summaries<br/>commit counts + total / longest render work<br/>per interaction and profiler"]
    Timeline --> ReactSummary
    ReactSummary --> ReportOut
    Windows --> Detectors["Detectors"]
    ResourceSampling --> ResourceWindows["Resource-sampling windows<br/>grouped by start/stop pair, not by interaction"]
    ResourceWindows --> Detectors
    ResourceWindows --> ReportOut
    Detectors --> Findings["Findings"]
    Findings --> ReportOut["HTML / JSON report"]
    Summary --> ReportOut
    ReportOut --> Preview["Bounded HTML previews"]
    ReportOut --> Index["JSON index + counts"]
    Index --> Pages["Pages: events once, findings by sequence range<br/>interactions + aggregate detail<br/>up to 1,000 records per page"]
